32	59	2025-12-04T20:56:59.455Z	text/markdown	## Query 1\r\n\r\nAttendance status = 'Present'\r\nEvent start falls within an IEP range\r\nIEP has a service assignment with the same service as the event therapist's service\r\nEvent matches to a valid event type\r\nStudent has an insurance assignment with insurer (1, 2, 3, 7) and type (12, 13)\r\nLEFT JOIN: most recent `vw_Consents` record (if any)  is signed\r\nLEFT JOIN: CONSENTS_NEW record (if any) has has `CN_New` = 1\r\nEvent matches to a valid school\r\nStudent has a school assignment\r\nSchool belongs to an active district\r\nThe attendance record has a treatment other than 99211, 90000, or 80000\r\nLEFT JOIN: Signer CredTherStatus in (1, 4, 5, 9)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Signer License Status not in (2, 3, 4, 5, 6)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Signer License Type in discipline (5, 8, 13, 49)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Supervisor CredThereStaTus in (1, 4, 5, 9)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Supervisor License Status not in (2, 3, 4, 5, 6)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Supervisor License Type in discipline (5, 8, 13, 49)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Event CredThereStatus in (1, 4, 5, 9)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Event License Status not in (2, 3, 4, 5, 6)\r\nLEFT JOIN: Event License Type in discipline (5, 8, 13, 49)\r\nEvent ended on or after today - 365\r\nEvent ended before today\r\nThere's no doctor's order matching the IEP service assignment OR there is one with a status other than 1\r\nThere's either a `vw_Consents` or `CONSENTS_NEW` record matching the LEFT JOINs above\r\nThere's no REFERRING_THERAPIST record matching the IEP ID and service OR there is one with a status of (3, 4, 11, 14)\r\n\r\n## Query 2\r\n\r\nAdd most frequent therapist, preferring signer > supervisor > event therapist when counting an event\r\nAdd school name from most recent event\r\n\r\n## Query 3\r\n\r\nJoin back to CRED tables to reapply same selection criteria as the LEFT JOINs above\r\n(Will also eliminate any records that don't have a therapist that met those criteria)	Event and attendance record eligibility criteria	2025-12-04 21:23:59.661+00	2025-12-04 21:23:59.661+00
