124	92	2026-03-19T18:14:53.312Z	text/markdown	Here are some details about how students, schools, and therapists tie together.\r\n\r\n`THERAPIST_ASSIGNMENTS` tie therapists to schools. They have a beginning and end date and a `UseCaseLoad` flag.\r\n\r\n`TherapistCaseLoads` ties Therapist + School assignments to students (no date span).\r\n\r\n`SCHOOL_ASSIGNMENTS` tie students to schools. They have a beginning and end date.\r\n\r\n`EVENTS` have both a therapist and a school.\r\n\r\n`EVENT_STUDENT_ASSIGNMENTS` tie an event to a student.\r\n\r\nIn `CalAttendance` the list of students is taken from the case load if `UseCaseLoad` is true for the therapist + school. Otherwise, it uses the student school assignment.	Therapist, school, and student assignment and attendance system logic	2026-03-19 18:21:29.886482+00	2026-03-19 18:26:01.831255+00
