199	49	2026-06-12T20:28:25.501Z	text/markdown	## Yesterday\r\n\r\nInitial testing, found unhandled exception on **View Caseload**.\r\n\r\nReason was missing stored proc. But in reviewing, realized that structural problems were hiding the real issue.\r\n\r\nRefactored a lot of things.\r\n\r\n## Today\r\n\r\nInitial testing, found missing stored proc on **Attendance Needed**.\r\n\r\nInvestigating code, found many of the same issues as on **View Caseload**.\r\nRefactored grid view binding code, eliminated lots of unnecessary date-picker related code.\r\n\r\nDate picker is failing to load because of script loading issue. Still need to investigate that.	Daily development log: testing, bug fixes, and refactoring	2026-06-12 20:29:23.08161+00	2026-06-12 20:29:23.08161+00
